+/* VBlank probe: where the machine hands a finished picture's time back to the frontend, and where it is
+   resumed. When it is resumed to be shut (retro_deinit), it leaves the way DOSBox leaves when its window
+   is closed: by throwing, which unwinds to start_dosbox and lets the configuration free what every part
+   of the machine holds (the PC's memory and the video card's above all). Without this the machine is
+   dropped where it stands and all of that memory is left behind. */
+void vblank_leave_frame(void)
+{
+    co_switch(mainThread);
+    if (frontend_exit) throw 0;
+}
